WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:05.880
Your Majesty Your Majesty Your Majesty the rebels have reached the city walls they.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.200
They they rescued Prince of Ning Sikong Zheng.

00:10.040 --> 00:14.547
And proclaimed Prince of Ning as emperor they also said what else did they say?

00:14.880 --> 00:17.080
They shot into the city arrows with messages attached.

00:17.960 --> 00:22.760
Spreading rumors that Your Majesty's ascension was illegitimate that Prince of Ning should have inherited the throne.

00:22.840 --> 00:26.000
Should have executed Prince of Ning long ago yes, yes this is what should we do?

00:26.080 --> 00:28.080
This was written by the rebels.

00:39.600 --> 00:41.040
How outrageous.

00:43.920 --> 00:47.720
Order the city defense forces to hold firm must hold until General Zu Yue arrives.

00:47.800 --> 00:48.960
Yes.

00:52.000 --> 01:05.500
In the twenty-first year of Longwu, the rebel army stormed into the imperial city, enthroned Prince Ning as the new Emperor, and beheaded you.

